      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787177751430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "URL Shortener\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- turn long url into short url\n - be redirected from original url to short url\n\n Entities\n- Original URL\n- Short URL\n- User\n\nAPI\n\n// Create New URL\nPOST /urls -> shortUrl\n{\n    originalUrl,\n    alias?,\n    expirationTime?\n}\n\n// Redirect\nGET {shortUrl} -> redirect to OriginalURL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "URL Shortener\n\nFunctional Requirements\n- turn long url into short url\n - be redirected from original url to short url\n\n Entities\n- Original URL\n- Short URL\n- User\n\nAPI\n\n// Create New URL\nPOST /urls -> shortUrl\n{\n    originalUrl,\n    alias?,\n    expirationTime?\n}\n\n// Redirect\nGET {shortUrl} -> redirect to OriginalURL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
