    },
    {
      "id": "9Ym_lRGMncc9XqU4xCa6f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -118.79998779296875,
      "y": -304.7999572753906,
      "width": 503.8396911621094,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1262633170,
      "version": 695,
      "versionNonce": 39398670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787179278279,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- Client sends Long URL and receives Short URL\n- Client goes to Short URL and is Redirected (301)\n\nNonfunctional Requirements\n- CAP: Availability > Consistency\n- Scale: 100M DAU \n- Uniqueness of urls\n- Low latency redirect\n\nEntities\n- User\n- URL\n\nAPI\nPOST /:originalurl body {url: google.com}\nGET /:shorturl -> redirect 301",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- Client sends Long URL and receives Short URL\n- Client goes to Short URL and is Redirected (301)\n\nNonfunctional Requirements\n- CAP: Availability > Consistency\n- Scale: 100M DAU \n- Uniqueness of urls\n- Low latency redirect\n\nEntities\n- User\n- URL\n\nAPI\nPOST /:originalurl body {url: google.com}\nGET /:shorturl -> redirect 301",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
